    fix(task-orchestrator): make epic idempotency atomic across replicas

    Replace pre-read/upsert race with atomic claim at ConPort PostgreSQL.
    Add POST /api/custom_data/claim with INSERT ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING.
    Propagate through DopeconBridge and shared client.
    Versioned fingerprint v1 for deterministic idempotency matching.

    Claim contract: CREATED | MATCHED | CONFLICT | LEGACY_UNFINGERPRINTED | OWNER_ERROR

    Co-authored-by: CommandCodeBot <noreply@commandcode.ai>
